    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than just another rhythm game, you are basically a <strong>walking 8-note instrument</strong> that you can <strong>customize</strong> and use to perform one of the two Mulong rituals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selve is a <strong>music adventure</strong> where you take on the role of a young member of the Mulong tribe from Selve Island. The people of this tribe have amazing <strong>musical powers</strong> thanks to their connection with the spirits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summon Mud Creatures</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/a545230e39bc56648a7d6cda8f5de902.poster.avif?t=1752117990\" width=478 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/a545230e39bc56648a7d6cda8f5de902.webm?t=1752117990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/a545230e39bc56648a7d6cda8f5de902.mp4?t=1752117990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take some <strong><i>Mul</i></strong> <i><strong>mud</strong></i> and sing freely to it, the mud will come to life, its abilities will depend on the characteristics of the melody you have played.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Sacred Melodies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/a792621bbecd794171d6d2f2edb0cd6d.poster.avif?t=1752117990\" width=478 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/a792621bbecd794171d6d2f2edb0cd6d.webm?t=1752117990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/a792621bbecd794171d6d2f2edb0cd6d.mp4?t=1752117990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mulong have created sacred melodies that do not require the use of <i><strong>Mul mud</strong></i>, but must be played perfectly to  properly work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bend wills with your melodies</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/f66e694d401c9c738023e79b4f7655fc.poster.avif?t=1752117990\" width=478 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/f66e694d401c9c738023e79b4f7655fc.webm?t=1752117990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/f66e694d401c9c738023e79b4f7655fc.mp4?t=1752117990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some characters will not cooperate with your mission, will you manipulate them using your musical powers?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your sound</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/57c6196738ac60305a0b769d03a3c7cf.poster.avif?t=1752117990\" width=478 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/57c6196738ac60305a0b769d03a3c7cf.webm?t=1752117990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/57c6196738ac60305a0b769d03a3c7cf.mp4?t=1752117990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your voice in this game is a very customizable synthesizer, if you change different proportions of your body, your sound will be different.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than just another rhythm game, you are basically a <strong>walking 8-note instrument</strong> that you can <strong>customize</strong> and use to perform one of the two Mulong rituals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selve is a <strong>music adventure</strong> where you take on the role of a young member of the Mulong tribe from Selve Island. The people of this tribe have amazing <strong>musical powers</strong> thanks to their connection with the spirits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summon Mud Creatures</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/a545230e39bc56648a7d6cda8f5de902.poster.avif?t=1752117990\" width=478 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/a545230e39bc56648a7d6cda8f5de902.webm?t=1752117990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/a545230e39bc56648a7d6cda8f5de902.mp4?t=1752117990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take some <strong><i>Mul</i></strong> <i><strong>mud</strong></i> and sing freely to it, the mud will come to life, its abilities will depend on the characteristics of the melody you have played.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Sacred Melodies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/a792621bbecd794171d6d2f2edb0cd6d.poster.avif?t=1752117990\" width=478 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/a792621bbecd794171d6d2f2edb0cd6d.webm?t=1752117990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/a792621bbecd794171d6d2f2edb0cd6d.mp4?t=1752117990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mulong have created sacred melodies that do not require the use of <i><strong>Mul mud</strong></i>, but must be played perfectly to  properly work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bend wills with your melodies</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/f66e694d401c9c738023e79b4f7655fc.poster.avif?t=1752117990\" width=478 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/f66e694d401c9c738023e79b4f7655fc.webm?t=1752117990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/f66e694d401c9c738023e79b4f7655fc.mp4?t=1752117990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some characters will not cooperate with your mission, will you manipulate them using your musical powers?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your sound</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/57c6196738ac60305a0b769d03a3c7cf.poster.avif?t=1752117990\" width=478 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/57c6196738ac60305a0b769d03a3c7cf.webm?t=1752117990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571850/extras/57c6196738ac60305a0b769d03a3c7cf.mp4?t=1752117990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your voice in this game is a very customizable synthesizer, if you change different proportions of your body, your sound will be different.</p>",
